    "verseCount": 3,
    "content": "<p class=\"d\">A Song of Ascents. By David.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"1\" data-sid=\"PSA 133:1\" class=\"v\">1</span>See how good and how pleasant it is</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 133:1\" class=\"q2\">for brothers to live together in unity!</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"2\" data-sid=\"PSA 133:2\" class=\"v\">2</span>It is like the precious oil on the head,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 133:2\" class=\"q2\">that ran down on the beard,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 133:2\" class=\"q2\">even Aaron’s beard,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 133:2\" class=\"q2\">that came down on the edge of his robes,</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"3\" data-sid=\"PSA 133:3\" class=\"v\">3</span>like the dew of Hermon,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 133:3\" class=\"q2\">that comes down on the hills of Zion;</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 133:3\" class=\"q2\">for there Yahweh gives the blessing,</p><p data-vid=\"PSA 133:3\" class=\"q2\">even life forever more.</p>",
